  "details": "See this example avatar https://vrchat.com/home/avatar/avtr_e80a189e-dd30-41ca-8be2-46866a6e3b44\n\nWhich has an eye height of ~0.16m\n\nIssue also affects other avatars below 0.2m\n\nWhen you change into the avatar, you get scaled up to have an eye height of 0.2m\n\nThis occurs on avatar load, unlike oversized avatars (which would only get scaled down when using the scale slider)\n\nAdditionally, using the reset height does not restore the original height (again unlike oversized avatars)\n\nThese undersized avatars should behave like oversized avatars, where you can load into the original height of the avatar, and restore that height using the reset height button after scaling.",
